"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Blast! I can't believe I fell for that potion trick."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"He didn't even tell me where Berlin was."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"teleportInAt","args":{"kind":"value","value":50}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Right..."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"walkTo","args":{"kind":"value","value":100}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"...well I couldn't get it all but I managed to turn some of your power back into potions and such."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"You'll find most of it on the first few screens."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Great! Thanks!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"I'll be off then..."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"walkTo","args":{"kind":"value","value":500}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Hold up there Speedy Gonzales!"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"walkTo","args":{"kind":"value","value":300}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"I need to tell you some other stuff."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"walkTo","args":{"kind":"value","value":400}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Ochre has got in with a bad crowd."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Who?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"The Magical Alliance!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Gasp!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"So?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"So, they are hiding out in the Magical Forest."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"So?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"So, they have drained all the Magic out of it!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Gulp!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Nope still don't get it."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"That's bad because when you go in there, you won't be able to summon your spells as well as normal."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"No magic around see?"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Oh dear, that's not good."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Indeed not."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"You will need an alternative weapon for when you face them."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"To be more precise, you will need to use the most powerful weapon known to this world!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Wow! Sounds cool, what is it?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"A Bloke With A Sword!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"?"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Q'est que ce que ca?"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Come again?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Blokes with swords are not affected by magic reducing situations."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Surely you know that?"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Well not affected no, but they're not great at staying in one piece in the face of an energy blast either are they?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Well no."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"And presumably the Magical Alliance has something similar to an Energy Blast do they?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Similar yes, slightly more powerful in fact."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Great."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"But look, so long as you train them up sufficiently they should be able to handle it."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"And you can always use monks to heal them."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Hmmm. And how do I train them up?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"By letting them kill stuff, the more stuff they kill, the stronger and better they will get."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Ok, that sounds good."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"You'll need the army summon spell to summon and unsummon your units."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Right, and where is that?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"It's in the Scarlet Wizard's storeroom due north of here."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Fire a 'blank' blast at a unit to unsummon them."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"I will lurk in the ether and instantly heal any units you unsummon."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Thanks, that will be useful."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"And how do I summon?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Charge a blast until you see the icon representing the unit you want to summon."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Then fire it where you want the unit to appear."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Don't fire at trees or rock or the unit won't appear."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"If the icon is faded out, it means there are none of that unit type in your army."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"If you have 8 units on screen already, the army summon won't charge past 'blank'."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Right, ok. All understood."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Have you got the Golden Machine Gun with you?"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Dang, I left it back at the flat!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Er, I mean at the Towers Of The Aldevar."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Well, there's no time to go back for it now."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"You'd best get started."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"One more thing before I go."}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Do you know where Berlin is?"}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"He is nearby but I cannot tell you more than that."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"The blue squares in the mini-map indicate where you can find blokes with swords and other people to add to your army."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Berlin will also show up blue. That should get you started."}},{"character":"ulin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Good luck!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"speakLine","args":{"kind":"text","text":"Thanks, boss!"}},{"character":"merlin","command":"exitStageRight","args":{"kind":"none"}},{"character":null,"command":"wait","args":{"kind":"value","value":30}},{"character":"ulin","command":"teleportOut","args":{"kind":"none"}},{"character":null,"command":"wait","args":{"kind":"value","value":30}},{"character":null,"command":"backgroundColourTo","args":{"kind":"value","value":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0}}},{"character":null,"command":"lightsDown","args":{"kind":"none"}}]}